I arrive at the office.
My colleague Jonas is already sitting at his desk.
He sees me and smiles.
"Good morning, Maya!" he says.
"Good morning, Jonas!" I reply.
"The weather is fantastic today," Jonas says.
"Yes, spring is finally here," I say.
"It is already really warm outside."
I go to my seat.
I sit down on my chair.
Then I open my backpack.
I take out my laptop.
I place the laptop on the desk.
I turn it on.
Jonas drinks his coffee and works.
I begin with my work.
